SUMMARY:▲ Peak-week fees rise: home deliveries go to $0.75–$0.80 a pack
 age\; big-box fees go up too
DESCRIPTION:UPS and Amazon Nov 22\, FedEx Nov 23\, through Dec 26 to 27.\nC
 arriers: UPS · Amazon · FedEx\nTakes effect between Nov 22\, 2026 and No
 v 23\, 2026\, depending on the carrier.\nUPS · Ground residential: $0.75\
 nFedEx · Ground residential: $0.80\nAmazon · Every package: $0.75\nUPS 
 · Air: $2.50\nFedEx · Express Overnight: $2.55\nFedEx · Ground Economy:
  $4.05\nUPS · Additional handling: $11.90\nFedEx · Additional handling: 
 $11.85\nUPS · Large package: $117.50\nFedEx · Oversize: $117.25\nStory: 
 Peak surcharges hit oversize packages now and home deliveries from Oct 24 
 to 26\nOn Parcel Pigeon: https://wmaready.github.io/parcel-pigeon/#s=01
