 conomy $2.55).\nCarriers: UPS · Amazon · FedEx\nTakes effect between Dec
  27\, 2026 and Dec 28\, 2026\, depending on the carrier.\nStory: Peak surc
 harges hit oversize packages now and home deliveries from Oct 24 to 26\nOn
